flowchart TD
    A[Draft response] --> B[Split into individual claims]
    B --> C[Classify each claim]
    C --> D[Assess volatility]
    D --> E[Assess consequence]
    E --> F{Evidence strength needed}
    F -->|Light check| G[Compare with nearby source]
    F -->|Direct source check| H[Verify against current source]
    F -->|Direct check plus review| I[Verify and obtain second review]
    G --> J[Record status]
    H --> J
    I --> J
    J --> K{Supported?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Keep claim]
    K -->|No| M[Qualify, investigate, or remove]